<title>USA: Ocean Reef offers Best Products to merge.</title>
<headline>Ocean Reef offers Best Products to merge.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ocean Reef Management Inc said Tuesday it had proposed a friendly merger with Best Products Co Inc in which it would pay its shareholders $2 in cash for every share they owned in the company.  </p>
<p>Ocean Reef said its offering price had a 52.67-percent premium over the closing price of Best Products on August 30, which was 1-5/16.</p>
<p>Ocean Reef Management Inc, a private investment company, recently acquired a controlling interest in L. Luria and Son Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
